###### 10. CONCLUSIONS 

- Pilot plants can make a huge difference in preventing metallurgical failure, provided they are prepared (planned, designed, constructed), operated and managed properly; 

- Key to success is detailed flowsheet design based on pre-pilot testwork, which combines continuous operating sequences with bench scale testwork on freshly produced samples; 

22 

